---
// spec: S05 (/board/11th)
import BoardClassPage from '../../components/BoardClassPage.astro';
---
<BoardClassPage
  cls="11th"
  heading="11th class (first year) test paper"
  intro="Inter part 1 ke liye group aur mazmoon ke mutabiq board pattern test paper."
  subjects={['English', 'Urdu', 'Islamiat', 'Physics', 'Chemistry', 'Biology', 'Maths', 'Computer Science', 'Statistics', 'Accounting', 'Economics', 'Civics']}
  faq={[
    { q: 'Mera group kaise batayun?', a: 'Mazmoon ke khane mein mazmoon likhein, maslan Physics ya Accounting. Group ya board ki koi khaas baat ho to order ke baad WhatsApp par bata dein.' },
    { q: 'Entry test ki tayyari ke liye bhi hai?', a: 'Yeh board pattern ka paper hai. Entry test ka pattern alag hota hai; us ke liye mazmoon ke MCQs zyada behtar hain.' },
    { q: 'Kya first year ke chapters ka mix ho sakta hai?', a: 'Haan. Chapters ke khane mein jo chahiye likh dein, maslan "Chapter 2, 4 aur 6".' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="paper-heading">First year: naya pattern, nayi aadat</h2>
  <p class="mt-3">
    11th class mein mazameen matric se kaafi gehre hote hain, aur har group ka apna rang hai: Pre-Medical mein Biology aur
    Chemistry, Pre-Engineering mein Maths aur Physics, ICS mein Computer Science aur Statistics ya Maths, aur Commerce mein
    Accounting aur Economics. Isi liye first year mein jaldi tayyari ka tareeqa bana lena faida deta hai.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Board ke paper ka dhancha matric jaisa hai: objective MCQs aur subjective short aur long sawal. Farq yeh hai ke sawal zyada
    samajh mangte hain. Physics aur Chemistry mein derivations aur numericals, Biology mein diagrams aur terms, aur Accounting mein
    entries aur statements ki practice ke baghair number nahin aate.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Har mahine jo chapters khatam hon un ka chhota test paper banwayen aur waqt laga kar hal karein. Is se saal ke aakhir mein
    sara bojh ek sath nahin aata. Jo sawal ghalat hon unhein dobara parhein, aur agla paper unhi chapters ko mila kar banwayen.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Teachers aur academies first year ke class tests ke liye bhi yeh paper le sakte hain. Order mein mazmoon, chapters aur kul
    number likhein; class pehle se 11th chuni hui hai.
  </p>
</BoardClassPage>
